    "content": "<div class=\"english-sans\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\n\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f44960-o1\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"44960\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/wp-admin/admin-post.php?action=export2json&#038;post_id=44961&#038;extension=.json#wpcf7-f44960-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init cf7skins cf7t-event cf7s-caspar\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"44960\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.1.6\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_US\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f44960-o1\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n</fieldset>\n<input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden\" id=\"referer-page\" value=\"\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"referer-page\" />\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<fieldset>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Translation</strong>. Copy your translation into the following textarea. Include any additional notes concerning ambiguities or provenance below your translation. <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"cf7s-message\"><textarea cols=\"40\" rows=\"10\" maxlength=\"24000\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea wpcf7-validates-as-required\" id=\"cf7s-message\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" name=\"cf7s-message\"></textarea></span> </li>\n\t</ul>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Provenance</strong>. (i.e., the origin of the work. required.) <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"menu-753\"><select class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-select wpcf7-validates-as-required\" id=\"menu-753\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" name=\"menu-753\"><option value=\"\">&#8212;Please choose an option&#8212;</option><option value=\"I am the creator/copyright steward of this translation\">I am the creator/copyright steward of this translation</option><option value=\"This is a derivative of a translation in the Public Domain\">This is a derivative of a translation in the Public Domain</option><option value=\"This is a derivative of someone else&#039;s Creative Commons licensed translation\">This is a derivative of someone else&#039;s Creative Commons licensed translation</option></select></span> </li>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Attribution statement</strong>.<br /><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"radio-13\"><span class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-radio\" id=\"radio-13\"><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item first\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-13\" value=\"Attribute this translation to me. (If you haven&#039;t contributed before, make sure to add your details below so that your contribution may be properly credited to you.)\" /><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item-label\">Attribute this translation to me. (If you haven&#039;t contributed before, make sure to add your details below so that your contribution may be properly credited to you.)</span></span><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item last\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"radio-13\" value=\"I prefer to remain anonymous.\" /><span class=\"wpcf7-list-item-label\">I prefer to remain anonymous.</span></span></span></span> </li>\n<p />&nbsp;<br />\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your Name or Pseudonym</strong> <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"cf7s-name\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text\" id=\"cf7s-name\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"cf7s-name\" /></span> </li>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your Email</strong>. (In case we need to follow-up with you for any reason. Your email will always remain private and will never be shared with a third-party.) <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"cf7s-email\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email\" id=\"cf7s-email\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"cf7s-email\" /></span> </li>\n\t</ul>\n<p />&nbsp;<br />\n<h4 style=\"text-transform: uppercase;\">Please add this information if you requested attribution (and if you haven't previously)</h4>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your preferred pronouns</strong>. (optional) We want to respect your gender expression in any future communications with you. <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"text-404\"><input size=\"50\" maxlength=\"128\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"text-404\" /></span> </li>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your webpage or website</strong>. (optional) Provide a URL for yourself or the project/organization you represent. <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"url-5\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-url wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-url\" id=\"url-5\" aria-invalid=\"false\" value=\"\" type=\"url\" name=\"url-5\" /></span> </li>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your bio</strong>. (optional) Provide a a short bio for yourself (3-5 sentences max). You are free to self-promote your work or preferred donation link here (e.g., patreon). If you have already done so in your profile, you can use this space to update that information if you wish. Your bio will be included in the bio box below your contribution and in the contributor's index. <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"textarea-821\"><textarea cols=\"40\" rows=\"10\" maxlength=\"2000\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea\" id=\"textarea-821\" aria-invalid=\"false\" name=\"textarea-821\"></textarea></span></li>\n\t\t<li> <strong>Your avatar</strong>. (optional) Provide an image representing who you are to the world (300×300px minimum, headshot preferred). This will represent you in our contributor's index and in a bio box below your contribution. <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap dropuploader-597\" style=\"position: static;\"><input size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-dropuploader\" accept=\"image/jpeg,image/jpeg,image/png,application/zip,zip,application/pdf,pdf\" data-maxfilesize=\"5242880\" aria-invalid=\"false\" type=\"file\" name=\"dropuploader-597[]\" multiple=\"multiple\" /></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n<p />&nbsp;<br />\n<h4 style=\"text-transform: uppercase;\">One Last Question</h4>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>This is just a check to see whether you're a spambot or not.<br /> <span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"quiz-922\"><label><span class=\"wpcf7-quiz-label\">Who knows one? If you know, write &#039;I know one&#039; (without the quotes).</span> <input size=\"40\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-quiz\" id=\"quiz-922\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" type=\"text\" name=\"quiz-922\" /></label><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_quiz_answer_quiz-922\" value=\"73b3df984a136bcd76464f68174f2509\" /></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 0.7em; border: 2; font-family: Inter;\"><input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" type=\"submit\" value=\"SUBMIT\" /></span>\n\n</fieldset>\n</div><p style=\"display: none !important;\" class=\"akismet-fields-container\" data-prefix=\"_wpcf7_ak_\"><label>&#916;<textarea name=\"_wpcf7_ak_hp_textarea\" cols=\"45\" rows=\"8\" maxlength=\"100\"></textarea></label><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"ak_js_1\" name=\"_wpcf7_ak_js\" value=\"171\"/><script>\ndocument.getElementById( \"ak_js_1\" ).setAttribute( \"value\", ( new Date() ).getTime() );\n</script>\n</p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n",
